<title>USA: Citizens Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Citizens Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>						Quarter ended March 31</p>
<p>						1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net income(A)			    $28.4	 $22.5</p>
<p> Net income per share		    0.80	  0.63</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		 35.3	  35.8</p>
<p>NOTE(A): Results for the first quarter of 1997 included $12.8 million of after-tax net realized investment gains, while 1996 first quarter results included $9.6 million of after-tax net realized investment gains.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
